# Español (Spanish) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35 in neutral Spanish; not yet reviewed line by line by a
# native speaker. Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder.
# The folder is "es", so every Spanish Windows (Spain and Latin America)
# picks it; a regional pack can sit on top of it with base = es.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = piloto, bike = moto, lap = vuelta, sector = sector,
#   split = parcial, gap = dif. / diferencia, PB = RP / récord personal,
#   standings = clasificación, pits = boxes, penalty = sanción,
#   session = sesión, practice = libres, qualify = clasificación,
#   race = carrera, settings = ajustes, hotkeys = atajos, rumble = vibración,
#   notice = aviso, callout = aviso de voz, achievement = logro,
#   profile = perfil, crash = caída, controller = mando, race number = dorsal,
#   web overlay = overlay web, On/Off = On/Off, Default = Estándar.
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, Companion, holeshot, whip,
#   scrub, oppo, endo, stoppie, backflip, frontflip, turn down, FMX, OBS.
